 "_comment": "What Blüemli is allowed to say, and when she has earned the right to say it. Each line is gated on words the learner has actually met - same trigger/min shape as patterns - so she never says something you would not understand, and she grows more idiomatic as you do. Every 'when' needs at least one ungated line or a brand new learner meets a silent cow. Keep lines SHORT: the speech bubble does not wrap. The pack key is still `momo` because that is what the app reads; the creature is not.",
